{"sourceUrl":"https://power.seu.edu.cn/2026/0707/c9506a575825/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:45.533027+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://power.seu.edu.cn/2026/0707/c9506a575825/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>东南大学能源与环境学院</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2027</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年接收推荐免试研究生报名通知</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>根据学校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生工作部署，制订本学院具体工作方案并通知如下。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、学院概况</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>历史悠久，底蕴深厚</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>能源与环境学院起源于原国立东南大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1923</span></span><span><span><span>年创立的电机工程系和机械工程系蒸汽动力方向和</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1942</span></span><span><span><span>年设置的卫生组，是当时国内最早开设能源学科和卫生工程的院系之一。中国能源学科的老前辈钱钟韩、吴大榕、范从振、王守泰、夏彦儒，环境学科的老前辈许葆玖、纽式如、胡家骏、秦麟源等名师曾在此执教。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>目前学院正紧密围绕“碳达峰、碳中和”战略，牵头优化学科布局、改善师资结构、引领研究方向、改革人才培养方案，打造高端智库与创新平台、培养优秀人才与领军人物。现有专任教师</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>179</span></span><span><span><span>人，在读本科生约</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>809</span></span><span><span><span>人，研究生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1487</span></span><span><span><span>余人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>学科卓越，平台坚实</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院拥动力工程及工程热物理、环境科学与工程</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>个一级学科，两个学科均为江苏省优势学科，动力工程及工程热物理在最新的学科评估位居全国前十，环境科学与工程位列全国前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>15%</span></span><span><span><span>，环境与生态学科的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span><span>排名已进入全球前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1%</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院建有“大型发电装备安全运行与智能测控国家工程研究中心”、“清洁高效燃煤发电与污染控制”国家重点实验室（共建）、“航天低温推进剂应用技术”全国重点实验室（共建）“能源热转换及其过程测控”教育部重点实验室、三个省级重点实验室以及多个校企联合研发中心。学院在九龙湖校区建有近</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>万平米的能环大楼，为学院发展提供了良好的教学科研环境。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>3.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>广纳英才，师资雄厚</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>学院广纳高层次人才，师资力量雄厚。共有专任教师</span><span><span>179</span><span>名，包括教授</span><span>/</span><span>研究员</span><span>76</span><span>名（含博士生导师</span><span>75</span><span>名）、副教授</span><span>/</span><span>副研究员</span><span>79</span><span>名（含博士生导师</span><span>25</span><span>名）、讲师</span><span>24</span><span>名，另有博士后及专职科研岗人员</span><span>70</span><span>人。拥有中国工程院院士</span><span>1</span><span>名、中国工程院外籍院士</span><span>1</span><span>名、澳大利亚两院院士</span><span>1</span><span>名、国家级人才</span><span>20</span><span>人次，国家级青年人才</span><span>48</span><span>人次，省级人才计划</span></span><span><span><span>入选</span><span>者</span></span><span>100</span><span>余</span></span><span><span></span><span>名。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>4.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>服务双碳，成果显著</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>面向国家“双碳”战略，学院重点在碳中和战略、低碳智慧能源系统、煤炭低碳高效利用、碳捕集、储能、新能源高效利用、发电系统安全、核能、污染低碳生态治理与资源化等方面开展创新性、前瞻性研究。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>年来被</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span><span>收录论文数达到</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4000</span></span><span><span><span>余篇，授权发明专利</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>700</span></span><span><span><span>余项，牵头承担国家及省部级以上科研项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>280</span></span><span><span><span>余项，其中科技部国家重点研发计划项目牵头</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span>项，国家重点研发计划课题</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span>余项，国家自然科学基金委重大重点项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>项、青</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span><span>项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>项、青</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>B</span></span><span><span><span>项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>项，面上、青年等项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>120</span></span><span><span><span>余项，江苏省厅级项目</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>120</span></span><span><span><span>余项。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身心健康</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>英语水平良好</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请本科直博者，除满足以上条件外，应热爱科学研究，具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜质。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、申请者报名</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>．系统报名要求</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）登录东南大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://gsas.seu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://gsas.seu.edu.cn</a></span></span><span><span><span>，以下简称“系统”），选择“接收推荐免试研究生”项目。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）报名时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span>日中午</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00 — 7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>31</span></span><span><span><span>日中午</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）申请者</span><span><span>只能申请一个志愿，<strong>请务必慎重选择</strong>，如实填写各项信息，信息填写完毕后认真核对，提交后将无法再做更改。</span><span>如未通过学院审核，可视其他学院报名时间申请第二个志愿。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>提交材料要求</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请者在系统中报名时，须线上提交以下材料，且须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性，若弄虚作假，一经发现，取消申请资格。</span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>材料清单</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>要    求</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>东南大学推荐免试研究生申请表</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>系统生成表格，下载打印后交学校教务部门或院系签章，本人手写签名后上传电子版；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>如已有学校教务部门或院系盖章的成绩排名证明，申请表中学校教务部门或院系签章可免，须将成绩排名证明一并上传。</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>有效身份证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>有效期内的居民身份证，正反面</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>在学证明</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>有效期内的《教育部学籍信息在线验证报告》</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span>现有本科阶段成绩单</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学校教务部门或学院盖章</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span>外语成绩证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span><span>等证书或成绩单</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span><span>学术成果证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>论文、专利、学科竞赛证书等</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span><span><span><span>奖励情况证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>校级以上（含）荣誉奖励证书</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>8.</span></span><span><span><span>实践经历证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>科研训练、实习实践、社会工作等相关证明</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9.</span></span><span><span><span>专家推荐信</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>如申请本科直博，还须提交与申请学科相关的两位具有副教授及以上（或相当）职称的专家（拟报考导师除外）填写的专家推荐信，按系统生成的专家推荐信模板，两位专家各填一份</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>10.</span></span><span><span><span>导师同意报考证明</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>如申请本科直博，须提交拟报考博士生导师的同意报考证明，微信聊天截图或者邮件往来记录均可。</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><span><strong>注：以上材料请端正扫描，并裁剪图片多余边框。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四、审核与确认</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>学院审核</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名结束后，学院</span></span><span><span>将从已提交报名信息的申请者中择优筛选</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span><span>届时将通过学院官网（</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://power.seu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://power.seu.edu.cn/</a><span><span><span><span>）公布入选名单。</span></span><span><span>请申请者及时关注学院官网发布的入选名单，以免错失机会。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>入选者确认</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>公布入选名单两天内，学院将通过系统发布具体工作安排</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>入选者须及时在系统中回复“确认参加”或“确认不参加”，未在规定时间内回复者，将视为自动放弃。</span></span><span><span>请入选者及时关注系统中的工作安排，以免错失机会。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>五、其他说明</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span>本学院应届本科生拟申请本学院推免的（含本学院跨专业申请），无需报名，其他均需报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>国际学院（苏州）</span></span></span><span><span>085800</span></span><span><span><span>能源动力专业由本学院负责培养，接收推荐免试研究生报名时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span>日中午</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00-8</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>日中午</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span><span>，具体见国际学院（苏州）网站通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span>如遇政策调整，以相关政策规定为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、咨询方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：徐老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>025-83794251</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>103009091@seu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>暑假期间（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日）尽量邮箱咨询。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"2d27c0393f347799c20ed1ab518d706e8a3cdb2ea86c0b2300e55900433d7507","textLength":2413,"sourceSha256":"106db725a7b83b0f7043e37c2080b46949aff3def588e9b771c5a9f1c04f38c5","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-86051064481acc163541","title":"2026年东南大学能源与环境学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:45.533027+00:00"}
